        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179-a3">

                <pb facs="0273" n="197" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg197"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Presidential Mandate, Published in the Official Gazette,
                        Sunday, October 22, 1916.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Hsu Shih-ying, the Minister of Communications, reports that he has made an
                    agreement with American merchants for the construction of railways. In
                    accordance with the terms of Article 17, certain additions have now been made.
                    Also a supplementary agreement has been submitted for approval.</p>
                <p>The agreement which has been entered into is approved and action should be taken
                    in accordance therewith. Let the Ministry concerned notify the Ministry of
                    Foreign Affairs and the Ministry of Finance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Seal of the President</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Issued <date calendar="gregorian" when="1916-10-20"
                                >October 20, 1916</date></hi></dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
